<title>USA: Option Care buys Columbia Medical.</title>
<headline>Option Care buys Columbia Medical.</headline>
<dateline>BANNOCKBURN, Ill. 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Option Care Inc said Tuesday it acquired Columbia Medical Services Inc, its franchised operation in Kennewick, Wash. Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>This transaction is Option Care's twelfth acquisition in 1996. The Kennewick franchise had revenues of $2.2 million in 1995.</p>
<p>Option Care is a home healthcare provider.</p>
<p>((-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
